  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can leap through the air, firing multiple shots, and possibly come down standing on your feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Leaping Shot Deed<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on Acrobatics checks made to jump increases by 2. If you have the Quick Draw feat, then for every 3 mythic tiers you possess, you can drop a firearm you’ve fired as part of the full-round action and draw another, firing it with a ─2 penalty at your highest base attack bonus. If you expend one use of your mythic power, you can roll back to your feet at the end of your move as a free action, rather than remaining prone.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-grit-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
